function checklist(){let i=0;return `<section id="linkedin-agency-score" class="original-tool inbound-workshop"><p class="tool-eyebrow">Proposal completeness checklist</p><h2>Review the evidence behind a LinkedIn agency proposal</h2><p>Mark an item only after reading the actual evidence or written term. This checks proposal completeness, not agency quality or likely performance. Essential answers cover qualification, tools and account access, incident handling and exit ownership.</p><div data-agency-proposal-checklist><div class="proposal-groups">${groups.map(g=>`<fieldset><legend>${esc(g.name)}</legend>${g.items.map((text,n)=>{const id='agency-evidence-'+i++;return `<label for="${id}"><input id="${id}" type="checkbox" data-evidence-item data-critical="${g.critical?.includes(n)?'true':'false'}">${esc(text)}</label>`}).join('')}</fieldset>`).join('')}</div><div class="proposal-result" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><strong data-evidence-count>0 of 12 evidence items reviewed</strong><p data-evidence-status>4 essential answers are still missing: tools and access, qualification, incident handling or exit ownership.</p></div><p><button type="button" data-evidence-reset>Reset this checklist</button></p><p class="tool-note">Checks stay on this page and reset when it reloads. No proposal details are collected, saved or sent to analytics. All boxes checked does not establish account safety, delivery quality or a guaranteed result.</p><noscript><p>You can use these twelve items as a written checklist. Interactive totals require JavaScript.</p></noscript></div></section>`;}
